%SIXMD 1
# @?CPUSPEED - COUNT INTEGER LOOPS FOR ABOUT ONE SECOND

## DESCRIPTION

COUNTS BATCHED INTEGER LOOPS UNTIL THE WALL-CLOCK DERIVED TICK VALUE ADVANCES BY ABOUT 60.

USAGE IS 'CPUSPEED'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/CPUSPEED
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/CPUSPEED.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

